No probed spec is attached to this call, so this is the reading-based audit:
work from the patch. Decide, for every other spec whose mapped code the patch
touches or can transitively affect, whether the patched implementation still
satisfies it.

A probe is available for only some of the other specs, and its absence means
nothing at all about the spec — it means that spec was not selected for
