## Output format

Return a single JSON object inside a fenced ```json block at the end of your response. Reason out loud first if it helps, but emit only ONE final JSON block.

```json
{
  "verdict": "approve | reject",
  "category": "valid | wrong_spec",
  "reasoning": "1-3 sentences. Name the spec you judged broken and quote the span of its text the patched implementation no longer satisfies, or state which specs you checked and why the patch leaves each intact."
}
```

Approve only when category is `valid`. Otherwise reject.
